\ { ( nameaddr -- )  RUNTIME: report the PREVIOUS bench (its elapsed time is
\        only known once the next one starts — same delayed-by-one scheme as
\        test.fam's ok reporting), then record this bench's name and start
\        tick.  b0 is captured LAST so the reporting I/O isn't timed.
: {
	bcount @ if _bprev then
	bcount @ 0= if _now bstart ! then
	bname !
	bcount @ 1 lit + bcount !
	0 lit bopn !
	0 lit bskf !
	0 lit btf !
	_now b0 !
;

